        {
          "id": "ad1546d5-35f5-4675-a42a-76dc8eb7064b",
          "name": "Enviance.Rest Services.Ver2.Messages.Impl.Message Service.Get Message",
          "request": {
            "name": "Enviance.Rest Services.Ver2.Messages.Impl.Message Service.Get Message",
            "description": {
              "content": "\n\nGets a message from the Enviance User Inbox. A User may only retrieve messages from his own Inbox. Getting a message through this API does NOT mark the message as *read*.\r\n\r\n**SDK API:**  `envianceSdk.messages.getMessage(messageId, onsuccess, onerror)`\r\n\r\n```\r\nGET /ver2/MessageService.svc/messages/d8ac14f5-c4b1-4db2-b0fc-15452f71737d HTTP/1.1\r\n\r\n//RESPONSE\r\n{\r\n  \"id\": \"d8ac14f5-c4b1-4db2-b0fc-15452f71737d\",\r\n  \"recipientId\": \"d2148a6f-4989-4a61-9c27-855a110f8c68\",\r\n  \"sentById\": \"21e1f9b6-fc7c-4257-85f1-01d097762d09\",\r\n  \"sentOn\": \"2013-06-14T14:07:52\",\r\n  \"subject\": \"Report Completion Notification: \\\"Emergency Checklist Report\\\"\",\r\n  \"body\": \"This is to notify you that the \\\"Emergency Checklist Report\\\" is complete.\",\r\n  \"type\": \"EmailNotification\",\r\n  \"archived\": false,\r\n  \"read\": false\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\n\n\nenvianceSdk.messages.getMessage\r\n```\r\n[\r\n  \"5bfdbd05-225f-40ee-bff1-2efe18a75375\",\r\n  \"onsuccess\",\r\n  \"onerror\"\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
